  "source_facts": [
    "Source60 normalizes parameter1 into normal/body resource. Nonzero parameter2 creates or reuses aux34 attachment and normalizes its resource; zero marks it for deletion and clears aux34. Packet position/facing are not assigned by this case",
    "438bc0 allocation is zero-initialized, callback0/action0/priority10/flags0x34. EAX preserves the allocated pointer despite decompiler void signature. Resource updates reuse child identity and do not force restart",
    "Ordinary43ba10 calls43d150 after main/mount helper and root submission. Owned state1/state2/state3 early-return before this hook, retaining attachment without advancing it",
    "43d150 entry caches current parent attachmentX/Y and adds current mount attachmentX/Y if present. Its attachment tail chooses action3 only when actual parent body action8; otherwise action0, and copies actual body facing each call",
    "Attachment helper is called once at speed100/mode0/staticFlip0, with its own flags0x34 and independent freeze state0. Only return0 queues a type1 child; return1 and negative codes suppress submission even if old graphics remain cached",
    "Child anchor is unshifted body screen plus cached parent AP plus current mount AP; the child adds its own native draw offsets/style, with the existing signed-short queue conversion. Do not double-count mount AP already applied to the main root",
    "Attachment animation events retain zero-initialized child screen coordinates0/0. They are not suppressed by the mount's0x200 scene9 sound mask",
    "Type1 child traverses before root, type0 mount after root; final equal-priority draw queue reverses insertion. Attachment shares the1024 child budget but consumes a slot only when helper0 and root exists, regardless of its drawable bitmap",
    "Ordinary duplicate graphic/cell culling still calls43d150 with root-1, so attachment helper/events advance without a submitted child. Outside-range owner removal returns before the hook. Root declared-resource1 filtering also does not prevent helper/slot effects",
    "Independent ownership releases attachment player on source60 removal, actor removal, scene reconstruction and owner close, without reproducing questionable native aux34/38 cleanup predicates"
  ],
